   577	    ``## AGENT PROFILE`` and no ``## FILE ASSIGNMENT`` — so a real named spawn
   578	    that merely lost one field still counts. Skipped rows stay OBSERVABLE via
   579	    the ``harness_probes_skipped`` counter: this suppresses a false alarm, it
   580	    does not hide the event.
   581	
   582	    PLAN-177 t2 (P1-f): those five are NECESSARY, NOT SUFFICIENT. Absence is
   583	    exactly the shape of the event this ratio exists to expose — a markerless
   584	    REAL spawn, including one admitted because the PreToolUse hook failed
   585	    open, matched all five and was deleted from the denominator. The row must
