   595	    # denominator — the exact event this ratio exists to expose. Until the
   596	    # EMITTER can stamp provenance the caller cannot forge, probe-shaped
   597	    # rows COUNT (the conservative direction for an advisory: a yellow the
   598	    # operator triages beats a green that hides a fail-open spawn).
   599	    # _has_harness_probe_fingerprint is kept (tested) as the shape
