   604	def check_skill_unknown_ratio() -> Tuple[str, str, Any]:
   605	    """Detect spawns that should have SKILL injection but didn't.
   606	
   607	    S94 follow-up: excludes intentionally skill-less archetypes —
   608	    `general-purpose` subagent dispatches via the mitigated rail
   609	    (ADR-082) by design have no SKILL.md anchor. They broker cross-
   610	    LLM gate calls and similar utility work; counting them as FPs
   611	    inflates the ratio to 100% during healthy Codex MCP sessions
   612	    and trains the operator to ignore the channel.
   613	
   614	    A spawn counts as "skill missing" ONLY when its `archetype` is
   615	    a custom (non-general-purpose) one AND `skill` is unknown/empty.
   616	    That is the original PLAN-020 ADR-051 governance gap the
   617	    detector was built for.
   618	    """
