  1256	    """Zero stale literals — and deliberately NO coupling to the repo's current
  1257	    VERSION file. Pinning the driver to VERSION would go red in the one window
  1258	    where the driver MUST be ahead of it: the moment TARGET_BASE is set for the
  1259	    next release and `bump` has not run yet. A gate that blocks the documented
  1260	    path is the failure mode this plan exists to close, not a new instance."""

