  2243	def _live_tool_versions() -> Dict[str, str]:
  2244	    """codex pins read from the LIVE governance files, not from memory.
  2245	
  2246	    Both pins drift by ceremony (the semver range has been widened four times);
  2247	    deriving them keeps this control testing the decision instead of decaying
  2248	    into a pin-drift alarm.
