1. P2 — `scripts/_framework_manifest_set.sh:783,874-875,880-925`; `scripts/install.sh:1869`; `scripts/upgrade.sh:3270-3272`

   Concrete failure scenario: the generated `.claude/.gitignore` tells adopters it is created only when absent and “NEVER” rewritten, but subsequent install/upgrade runs append missing security entries. An adopter relying on that ownership promise can deliberately remove an entry and be surprised when it returns.

